{"page":143,"verses":[{"verse_key":"6:119","surah":6,"ayah":119,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَا لَكُمْ أَلَّا تَأْكُلُوا۟ مِمَّا ذُكِرَ ٱسْمُ ٱللَّهِ عَلَيْهِ وَقَدْ فَصَّلَ لَكُم مَّا حَرَّمَ عَلَيْكُمْ إِلَّا مَا ٱضْطُرِرْتُمْ إِلَيْهِ ۗ وَإِنَّ كَثِيرًا لَّيُضِلُّونَ بِأَهْوَآئِهِم بِغَيْرِ عِلْمٍ ۗ إِنَّ رَبَّكَ هُوَ أَعْلَمُ بِٱلْمُعْتَدِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Why should you not eat such animals when God has already fully explained what He has forbidden you, except when forced by hunger? But many lead others astray by their desires, without any true knowledge: your Lord knows best who oversteps the limit.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"6:119"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"6:119"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَلَّا","en_gloss":"that not","transliteration":"allā","verse_key":"6:119"},{"pos":4,"ar":"تَأْكُلُوا۟","en_gloss":"you eat","transliteration":"takulū","verse_key":"6:119"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِمَّا","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"mimmā","verse_key":"6:119"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ذُكِرَ","en_gloss":"has been mentioned","transliteration":"dhukira","verse_key":"6:119"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱسْمُ","en_gloss":"(the) name","transliteration":"us'mu","verse_key":"6:119"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"6:119"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"on it","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","verse_key":"6:119"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَقَدْ","en_gloss":"when indeed","transliteration":"waqad","verse_key":"6:119"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فَصَّلَ","en_gloss":"He (has) explained in detail","transliteration":"faṣṣala","verse_key":"6:119"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَكُم","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"6:119"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"6:119"},{"pos":14,"ar":"حَرَّمَ","en_gloss":"He (has) forbidden","transliteration":"ḥarrama","verse_key":"6:119"},{"pos":15,"ar":"عَلَيْكُمْ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","verse_key":"6:119"},{"pos":16,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"6:119"},{"pos":17,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"6:119"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱضْطُرِرْتُمْ","en_gloss":"you are compelled","transliteration":"uḍ'ṭurir'tum","verse_key":"6:119"},{"pos":19,"ar":"إِلَيْهِ ۗ","en_gloss":"to it","transliteration":"ilayhi","verse_key":"6:119"},{"pos":20,"ar":"وَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"wa-inna","verse_key":"6:119"},{"pos":21,"ar":"كَثِيرًۭا","en_gloss":"many","transliteration":"kathīran","verse_key":"6:119"},{"pos":22,"ar":"لَّيُضِلُّونَ","en_gloss":"surely lead astray","transliteration":"layuḍillūna","verse_key":"6:119"},{"pos":23,"ar":"بِأَهْوَآئِهِم","en_gloss":"by their (vain) desires","transliteration":"bi-ahwāihim","verse_key":"6:119"},{"pos":24,"ar":"بِغَيْرِ","en_gloss":"without","transliteration":"bighayri","verse_key":"6:119"},{"pos":25,"ar":"عِلْمٍ ۗ","en_gloss":"knowledge","transliteration":"ʿil'min","verse_key":"6:119"},{"pos":26,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"6:119"},{"pos":27,"ar":"رَبَّكَ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbaka","verse_key":"6:119"},{"pos":28,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"He","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"6:119"},{"pos":29,"ar":"أَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"(is) most knowing","transliteration":"aʿlamu","verse_key":"6:119"},{"pos":30,"ar":"بِٱلْمُعْتَدِينَ","en_gloss":"of the transgressors","transliteration":"bil-muʿ'tadīna","verse_key":"6:119"},{"pos":31,"ar":"١١٩","en_gloss":"(119)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:119"}]},{"verse_key":"6:120","surah":6,"ayah":120,"ar_uthmani":"وَذَرُوا۟ ظَـٰهِرَ ٱلْإِثْمِ وَبَاطِنَهُۥٓ ۚ إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ يَكْسِبُونَ ٱلْإِثْمَ سَيُجْزَوْنَ بِمَا كَانُوا۟ يَقْتَرِفُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Avoid committing sin, whether openly or in secret, for those who commit sin will be repaid for what they do,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَذَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"Forsake","transliteration":"wadharū","verse_key":"6:120"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ظَـٰهِرَ","en_gloss":"open","transliteration":"ẓāhira","verse_key":"6:120"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْإِثْمِ","en_gloss":"[the] sins","transliteration":"l-ith'mi","verse_key":"6:120"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَبَاطِنَهُۥٓ ۚ","en_gloss":"and the secret","transliteration":"wabāṭinahu","verse_key":"6:120"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"6:120"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"6:120"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَكْسِبُونَ","en_gloss":"earn","transliteration":"yaksibūna","verse_key":"6:120"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْإِثْمَ","en_gloss":"[the] sin","transliteration":"l-ith'ma","verse_key":"6:120"},{"pos":9,"ar":"سَيُجْزَوْنَ","en_gloss":"they will be recompensed","transliteration":"sayuj'zawna","verse_key":"6:120"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"for what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"6:120"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they used to","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"6:120"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَقْتَرِفُونَ","en_gloss":"commit","transliteration":"yaqtarifūna","verse_key":"6:120"},{"pos":13,"ar":"١٢٠","en_gloss":"(120)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:120"}]},{"verse_key":"6:121","surah":6,"ayah":121,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَا تَأْكُلُوا۟ مِمَّا لَمْ يُذْكَرِ ٱسْمُ ٱللَّهِ عَلَيْهِ وَإِنَّهُۥ لَفِسْقٌ ۗ وَإِنَّ ٱلشَّيَـٰطِينَ لَيُوحُونَ إِلَىٰٓ أَوْلِيَآئِهِمْ لِيُجَـٰدِلُوكُمْ ۖ وَإِنْ أَطَعْتُمُوهُمْ إِنَّكُمْ لَمُشْرِكُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and do not eat anything over which God’s name has not been pronounced, for that is breaking the law. The evil ones incite their followers to argue with you: if you listen to them, you too will become idolaters.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"6:121"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَأْكُلُوا۟","en_gloss":"eat","transliteration":"takulū","verse_key":"6:121"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِمَّا","en_gloss":"of that","transliteration":"mimmā","verse_key":"6:121"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَمْ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"6:121"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يُذْكَرِ","en_gloss":"has been mentioned","transliteration":"yudh'kari","verse_key":"6:121"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱسْمُ","en_gloss":"(the) name","transliteration":"us'mu","verse_key":"6:121"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"6:121"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"on it","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","verse_key":"6:121"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَإِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"and indeed, it (is)","transliteration":"wa-innahu","verse_key":"6:121"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَفِسْقٌۭ ۗ","en_gloss":"grave disobedience","transliteration":"lafis'qun","verse_key":"6:121"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"wa-inna","verse_key":"6:121"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلشَّيَـٰطِينَ","en_gloss":"the devils","transliteration":"l-shayāṭīna","verse_key":"6:121"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لَيُوحُونَ","en_gloss":"inspire","transliteration":"layūḥūna","verse_key":"6:121"},{"pos":14,"ar":"إِلَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"6:121"},{"pos":15,"ar":"أَوْلِيَآئِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their friends","transliteration":"awliyāihim","verse_key":"6:121"},{"pos":16,"ar":"لِيُجَـٰدِلُوكُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"so that they dispute with you","transliteration":"liyujādilūkum","verse_key":"6:121"},{"pos":17,"ar":"وَإِنْ","en_gloss":"and if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"6:121"},{"pos":18,"ar":"أَطَعْتُمُوهُمْ","en_gloss":"you obey them","transliteration":"aṭaʿtumūhum","verse_key":"6:121"},{"pos":19,"ar":"إِنَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"indeed, you","transliteration":"innakum","verse_key":"6:121"},{"pos":20,"ar":"لَمُشْرِكُونَ","en_gloss":"(would) be the polytheists","transliteration":"lamush'rikūna","verse_key":"6:121"},{"pos":21,"ar":"١٢١","en_gloss":"(121)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:121"}]},{"verse_key":"6:122","surah":6,"ayah":122,"ar_uthmani":"أَوَمَن كَانَ مَيْتًا فَأَحْيَيْنَـٰهُ وَجَعَلْنَا لَهُۥ نُورًا يَمْشِى بِهِۦ فِى ٱلنَّاسِ كَمَن مَّثَلُهُۥ فِى ٱلظُّلُمَـٰتِ لَيْسَ بِخَارِجٍ مِّنْهَا ۚ كَذَٰلِكَ زُيِّنَ لِلْكَـٰفِرِينَ مَا كَانُوا۟ يَعْمَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Is a dead person brought back to life by Us, and given light with which to walk among people, comparable to someone trapped in deep darkness who cannot escape? In this way the evil deeds of the disbelievers are made to seem alluring to them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَوَمَن","en_gloss":"Is (one) who","transliteration":"awaman","verse_key":"6:122"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"was","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"6:122"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَيْتًۭا","en_gloss":"dead","transliteration":"maytan","verse_key":"6:122"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَأَحْيَيْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"and We gave him life","transliteration":"fa-aḥyaynāhu","verse_key":"6:122"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَجَعَلْنَا","en_gloss":"and We made","transliteration":"wajaʿalnā","verse_key":"6:122"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"for him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"6:122"},{"pos":7,"ar":"نُورًۭا","en_gloss":"light","transliteration":"nūran","verse_key":"6:122"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَمْشِى","en_gloss":"he walks","transliteration":"yamshī","verse_key":"6:122"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"whereby","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"6:122"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"among","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"6:122"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"the people","transliteration":"l-nāsi","verse_key":"6:122"},{"pos":12,"ar":"كَمَن","en_gloss":"like (one) who","transliteration":"kaman","verse_key":"6:122"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مَّثَلُهُۥ","en_gloss":"[similar to him]","transliteration":"mathaluhu","verse_key":"6:122"},{"pos":14,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"6:122"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلظُّلُمَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"the darknesses","transliteration":"l-ẓulumāti","verse_key":"6:122"},{"pos":16,"ar":"لَيْسَ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"laysa","verse_key":"6:122"},{"pos":17,"ar":"بِخَارِجٍۢ","en_gloss":"he comes out","transliteration":"bikhārijin","verse_key":"6:122"},{"pos":18,"ar":"مِّنْهَا ۚ","en_gloss":"of it","transliteration":"min'hā","verse_key":"6:122"},{"pos":19,"ar":"كَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"Thus","transliteration":"kadhālika","verse_key":"6:122"},{"pos":20,"ar":"زُيِّنَ","en_gloss":"is made fair-seeming","transliteration":"zuyyina","verse_key":"6:122"},{"pos":21,"ar":"لِلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_gloss":"to the disbelievers","transliteration":"lil'kāfirīna","verse_key":"6:122"},{"pos":22,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"6:122"},{"pos":23,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they were","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"6:122"},{"pos":24,"ar":"يَعْمَلُونَ","en_gloss":"doing","transliteration":"yaʿmalūna","verse_key":"6:122"},{"pos":25,"ar":"١٢٢","en_gloss":"(122)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:122"}]},{"verse_key":"6:123","surah":6,"ayah":123,"ar_uthmani":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ جَعَلْنَا فِى كُلِّ قَرْيَةٍ أَكَـٰبِرَ مُجْرِمِيهَا لِيَمْكُرُوا۟ فِيهَا ۖ وَمَا يَمْكُرُونَ إِلَّا بِأَنفُسِهِمْ وَمَا يَشْعُرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"And so We have put chief evildoers in every city to perpetrate their schemes there- but they scheme only against themselves, without realizing it.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"And thus","transliteration":"wakadhālika","verse_key":"6:123"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَعَلْنَا","en_gloss":"We placed","transliteration":"jaʿalnā","verse_key":"6:123"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"6:123"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كُلِّ","en_gloss":"every","transliteration":"kulli","verse_key":"6:123"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَرْيَةٍ","en_gloss":"city","transliteration":"qaryatin","verse_key":"6:123"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَكَـٰبِرَ","en_gloss":"greatest","transliteration":"akābira","verse_key":"6:123"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مُجْرِمِيهَا","en_gloss":"(of) its criminals","transliteration":"muj'rimīhā","verse_key":"6:123"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لِيَمْكُرُوا۟","en_gloss":"so that the